[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Command Dispatch, Telemetry, Sequencing, Time, and Flight Memory Operations

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-CDH-001
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Four-Stage Command Verification Tracking
STATEMENT: >>>
The command service (CmdService) shall track in-flight commands by monotonic sequence ID and emit structured four-stage verification reports (Accepted, Started, Progress with step/percentage, and Completed with CmdResult) into a lock-free report ring.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Long-running instrument operations such as partial FPGA reconfiguration, focal-plane cooldowns, and self-tests require granular progress visibility rather than a single final completion code.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: services/cdh/include/strata/services/cdh/cmd_service.hpp
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-CDH-002
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Per-Partition Command Authorization and SDLS Enforcement
STATEMENT: >>>
The command service shall validate every incoming command against a static per-source-partition opcode allowlist and mandatory SDLS authentication flag before accepting or forwarding the command to any target partition.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Role-based opcode filtering prevents unprivileged autonomy or science partitions from invoking safety-critical spacecraft commands.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: services/cdh/include/strata/services/cdh/cmd_service.hpp
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-CDH-003
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Compile-Time-Sized Telemetry Packetizer
STATEMENT: >>>
The telemetry packetizer (TlmPacketizer) shall bind each packet APID to a compile-time-verified WirePod struct layout checked via static_assert against the CCSDS Space Packet MTU and sample directly from lock-free Seqlock Blackboards without dynamic per-field buffer copies.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Compile-time struct layout verification makes fixed-slot buffer overflow corruption across adjacent telemetry channels impossible.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: services/cdh/include/strata/services/cdh/telemetry.hpp
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-004

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-CDH-004
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: On-Demand Single-Channel Telemetry Snapshot Query
STATEMENT: >>>
The telemetry service shall provide an on-demand channel query adapter allowing ground operators or onboard autonomy to request the latest individual Blackboard snapshot for a specific channel ID outside the periodic packetizer cadence.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
During commissioning and anomaly triage, operators need immediate ad-hoc sampling of individual diagnostic channels without reconfiguring packet schedules.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: services/cdh/include/strata/services/cdh/telemetry_query.hpp
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-CDH-005
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Online Parameter Statistics Collector
STATEMENT: >>>
The telemetry service shall provide an O(1)-RAM online StatsCollector using Welford's algorithm to compute min, max, mean, variance, and sample count over high-rate telemetry signals for compact periodic downlink summaries.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Computing summary statistics on board captures transient power, thermal, and timing excursions while reducing downlink bandwidth by more than an order of magnitude.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: services/cdh/include/strata/services/cdh/telemetry.hpp
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-006

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-CDH-006
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Dynamic Per-APID Telemetry Forwarding Control
STATEMENT: >>>
The telemetry service shall provide a ForwardingControl table enabling ground commands or onboard sequences to switch any APID dynamically among Muted, StoreOnly, LiveRf, and LiveAndStore modes.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Missions with intermittent contact passes and variable RF link margins require dynamic control over real-time vs. store-and-forward telemetry routing.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: services/cdh/include/strata/services/cdh/telemetry.hpp
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-CDH-007
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Multi-Slot Concurrent Command Sequencer
STATEMENT: >>>
The command sequencer (SeqEngine) shall execute multiple concurrent CRC-32C-verified binary command sequences supporting Immediate, Relative-delay, and Absolute-TAI execution steps, aborting a sequence automatically on step failure and exposing an immediate abort_all hook for safe-mode entry.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Deterministic onboard command sequencing automates science campaigns and eclipse transitions during out-of-contact orbital segments.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: services/cdh/include/strata/services/cdh/sequencer.hpp
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-CDH-008
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Allowlisted On-Orbit Memory Dwell
STATEMENT: >>>
The flight memory service (FlightMemoryOps) shall support surgical diagnostic Memory Dwell reads strictly bounded by a static authorized address-range allowlist, returning PermissionDenied on any out-of-range or unmapped address.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
On-orbit debugging requires inspecting authorized RAM and hardware register windows without risking bus faults from operator typos.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: services/cdh/include/strata/services/cdh/flight_ops.hpp
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-CDH-009
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Two-Step Authenticated Surgical Memory Patch
STATEMENT: >>>
The flight memory service shall enforce a two-step arm_patch followed by commit_patch workflow requiring both write-allowlist authorization and matching CRC-32C verification at arm and commit before modifying any authorized RAM region.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Two-step CRC-confirmed patching enables emergency on-orbit table or flight fixes while preventing accidental corruption from single-command errors.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: services/cdh/include/strata/services/cdh/flight_ops.hpp
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-CDH-010
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Background Immutable Software Segment Checksum Scrubber
STATEMENT: >>>
The flight memory service shall periodically compute CRC-32C checksums over registered immutable code, constant data, and routing-table segments during background slack time and immediately report the corrupted segment ID upon any mismatch.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Background software scrubbing complements hardware FPGA configuration scrubbing by catching radiation-induced bit-flips in instruction memory and static tables.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: services/cdh/include/strata/services/cdh/flight_ops.hpp
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-CDH-011
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Time Base Converter and 1PPS Drift Monitor
STATEMENT: >>>
The C&DH time service shall provide a deterministic TimeConverter translating among hardware TAI nanoseconds, Spacecraft Clock (SCLK) coarse/fine ticks, and UTC/mission epoch with leap-second offset tables and 1PPS clock-drift anomaly monitoring.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Science data products and CCSDS ground systems require exact bidirectional correlation between onboard TAI counters and ground UTC/SCLK epochs.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: services/cdh/include/strata/services/cdh/time_and_sysmon.hpp
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-006

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-CDH-012
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Live Hardware/Software Build Identity and System Resource Monitor
STATEMENT: >>>
The C&DH system service shall report BuildManifestInfo combining firmware git SHA, ABI version, compile-time MANIFEST_HASH, and live hardware SCSR identities alongside a SysMonitor Blackboard publishing per-partition CPU headroom, frame jitter min/max, DDR pool high-water marks, NoC stalls, and cumulative SEU counts.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Operators must continuously verify both active software and active FPGA bitstream identities while tracking thermal, CPU, memory, and radiation margins.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: services/cdh/include/strata/services/cdh/time_and_sysmon.hpp
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-CDH-013
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Optional Compile-Time Console Diagnostic Text Sink
STATEMENT: >>>
The C&DH service shall provide an optional, compile-time-disableable TextLogSink converting binary EventRecords into bounded ASCII lines over UART, JTAG/SWO, or host stdout for benchtop bring-up without imposing string-formatting overhead on flight builds.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Human-readable console logging accelerates FlatSat and SIL debugging while remaining zero-overhead when compiled out for flight.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Demonstration
ARTIFACT: services/cdh/include/strata/services/cdh/time_and_sysmon.hpp
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-008

[[/SECTION]]
